findings.body:
`RequestHandler.cookies` was a documented public property; the diff deletes it and updates only the two in-tree call sites. Any application subclass, mixin, or template doing `self.cookies` / `handler.cookies` now gets an AttributeError. Keep a thin forwarding property on RequestHandler:

    @property
    def cookies(self):
        return self.request.cookies

That preserves the existing contract while still letting request-level code read cookies directly.
